        {
          "content_id": "p10-vc-explanation-b9a5582bf33cea0a4724b9d3",
          "content_sha256": "48d11e24dd3aaa64bd9d499b93c09731ca2bc5c0c22d1fde5aec84309afdd442",
          "content_text": "它的视觉-IMU子系统不依赖于环境中的显著视觉特征，节省了特征检测和提取的处理时间，尤其在缺少纹理的环境中提高了系统的鲁棒性。\nIMU\t不受环境变化影响\t具有累计误差",
          "content_type": "verified_answer_explanation",
          "course_id": "course_ai_algorithms_systems",
          "idempotency_key": "p10:gold-qa-88df7a33d6aafc988099d1a87df97201:explanation",
